---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for Private Sound Recorder and Flashlight (no UI).">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-5 sm:py-20 prose-custom">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-paper sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-mist">
      <strong class="text-paper/80">Effective date:</strong> July 7, 2026
      &nbsp;|&nbsp;
      <strong class="text-paper/80">Last updated:</strong> July 31, 2026
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-mist">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy describes how <strong class="text-paper">Private Sound Recorder</strong> and
        <strong class="text-paper">Flashlight (no UI)</strong> (the “Apps”) handle information when you use them.
        The Apps are published on Google Play under the package names
        <code class="rounded bg-ink-3 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm text-paper/90">avinash42.soundrecorder</code>
        and
        <code class="rounded bg-ink-3 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm text-paper/90">avinash42.touch.torch</code>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Questions? Contact:
        <a class="link-underline text-sky hover:text-teal" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display pt-4 text-2xl font-bold text-paper">Summary</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full border-collapse text-left text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/15 text-paper">
              <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold"></th>
              <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold">Private Sound Recorder</th>
              <th class="py-2 font-semibold">Flashlight (no UI)</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/10">
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 text-paper/80">Internet access</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-4">No</td>
              <td class="py-2">No</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/10">
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 text-paper/80">Account required</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-4">No</td>
              <td class="py-2">No</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/10">
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 text-paper/80">Cloud upload</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-4">No</td>
              <td class="py-2">No</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 text-paper/80">Ads or analytics</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-4">No</td>
              <td class="py-2">No</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h2 class="font-display pt-4 text-2xl font-bold text-paper">1. What stays on your device</h2>
      <p>
        <strong class="text-paper">Private Sound Recorder</strong> stores recordings and settings on your device:
        audio files, titles, durations, dates, waveforms, bookmarks, and preferences. It never sends this data
        over the internet.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong class="text-paper">Flashlight (no UI)</strong> does not collect or store personal data. It only
        controls your device flashlight when you open the app icon.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display pt-4 text-2xl font-bold text-paper">2. Permissions</h2>
      <p>
        Private Sound Recorder may use the microphone, storage/media access, notifications, vibration (optional),
        and exact alarms for scheduled recordings. Flashlight may use the camera/flashlight permission only to
        turn the torch on and off.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display pt-4 text-2xl font-bold text-paper">3. What we do not do</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>No ads, no analytics SDKs, no sale of personal data.</li>
        <li>No accounts, no cloud sync, and no sharing of data with third parties.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display pt-4 text-2xl font-bold text-paper">4. Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        If you use Android’s share feature in Private Sound Recorder, the app or service you choose receives the
        file under its own privacy policy.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display pt-4 text-2xl font-bold text-paper">5. Deletion</h2>
      <p>
        Delete recordings in Private Sound Recorder or on your device. Uninstalling either App removes private
        app data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display pt-4 text-2xl font-bold text-paper">6. Security</h2>
      <p>Protect your device with a strong lock screen. Neither App transmits your personal data over the network.</p>

      <h2 class="font-display pt-4 text-2xl font-bold text-paper">7. Children</h2>
      <p>The Apps are not intended for children under 13.</p>

      <h2 class="font-display pt-4 text-2xl font-bold text-paper">8. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy and change the “Last updated” date above.</p>

      <h2 class="font-display pt-4 text-2xl font-bold text-paper">9. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        <a class="link-underline text-sky hover:text-teal" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
